<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-ATP TOURNAMENT FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ATP TOURNAMENT FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at the $425,000 Men's ATP Tennis Tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat Jens Knippschild (Germany) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) beat Alexander Volkov (Russia) 6-4 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat Jordi Burillo (Spain) 3-6 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>1-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Alexander Radulescu (German) 7-6 (7-3) 7-6 (7-5)  </p>
<p>Marcelo Charpentier (Argentina) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 4-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Lucas Arnold (Argentina) 7-5 6-4.</p>
</text>
